### Categories (seeded by V3 migration)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### Create an item in "Weapons"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Bronze sword", "description": "Sharp", "price": {"amount": "120.50", "currency": "EUR"},
  "categoryId": "01900000-0000-7000-8000-000000000003"}

> {% client.global.set("location", response.headers.valueOf("Location")); %}

### Read it back
GET {{location}}

### Items of "Weapons"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/items?category=01900000-0000-7000-8000-000000000003

### What the JVM sees inside the container
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/runtime

### Readiness probe
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/readiness
